;;; core.grothendieck — Umbrella module for Grothendieck's Three-Era Vision
;;; and Beyond-Grothendieck Frontiers:
;;;   - Era 1 (1949-1955): Nuclear spaces, topological tensor products, Grothendieck's inequality
;;;   - Era 2 (1955-1970): SGA etale Weil conjectures, K0(Var) motives, Grothendieck-Riemann-Roch
;;;   - Missing Pillars:   Standard conjectures, crystalline/Dieudonne, six operations, weights, universes
;;;   - Era 3A (1983-1991): Pursuing Stacks, Kan vs Lurie quasi-categories, higher stacks, Les Derivateurs
;;;   - Era 3B (1981-1984): Esquisse d'un Programme, dessins d'enfants, anabelian/GT, tame topology, perfectoid tilting
;;;   - Beyond Frontiers:  F1/Borger lambda-rings, noncommutative Ore failure, Arakelov, (infty,2) directed, Bers T(1)/abc

